## 12. UI/UX & Responsive Design

* **Fluid Breakpoints**: Optimized for mobile phones (375px+ up to full 4K screens).
* **RTL Translation Layout**: Text alignments, arrows (`ArrowLeft` / `ArrowRight`), and grid columns mirror smoothly when switching from English to Arabic.
* **Aesthetic Palette**: Gold (`#D4AF37`) and deep slate grey accents, avoiding generic bright colors to emphasize a high-end consulting brand.
* **No Scrollbar Constraints**: Isolated document viewing routes (`/certificate/$id`) rely on native browser zoom, making it extremely easy to read on mobile devices.

